  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VirtualScienceLab.InteractableObject
  _equipmentName: Computer Workstation
  _description: Laboratory computers record measurements, organise results and display
    graphs. Scientists use software to calculate averages, compare data and look
    for patterns. Record units, measurement uncertainty and experimental conditions
    alongside each result. Keep liquids away from the keyboard and electronics, back
    up your work, and check that conclusions are supported by the data.
