  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VirtualScienceLab.InteractableObject
  _equipmentName: Test Tube 4
  _description: 'Test tubes hold small liquid samples for observations and small-scale
    reactions. A rack keeps them upright and separates samples. Label each sample,
    use clean tubes to avoid contamination, and compare observations such as colour
    or precipitate formation. These capped tubes represent stored samples: never
    heat a sealed tube. Use a holder and point an open tube away from people when
    heating.'
