  _equipmentName: Beaker 2
  _description: Beakers hold, mix and, when made from suitable heat-resistant glass,
    heat liquids. Their wide opening allows easy stirring and pouring. Graduation
    marks give approximate volumes; use a graduated cylinder or volumetric glassware
    for accurate measurements. The coloured liquid here is an illustrative sample,
    not a chemical identification. Wear eye protection and never taste laboratory
    samples.
